cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "ถ้าใช้ข้อมูลนี้ กรุณาอ้างอิงตามนี้ · If you use this data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "open-thai-law/laws: Thai legislation as a git history"
abstract: >-
  Thai primary legislation (acts, codes, constitutions, emergency decrees and
  orders of revolutionary councils) as one Markdown file per law, with one git
  commit per amendment dated by when it took effect and authored by the body
  that enacted it. Converted from the database of the Office of the Council of
  State. Unofficial.
authors:
  - name: "Open Thai Law contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/open-thai-law"
repository-code: "https://github.com/open-thai-law/laws"
url: "https://github.com/open-thai-law/laws"
license: CC0-1.0
version: "2026-10-30.1"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
keywords:
  - Thailand
  - law
  - legislation
  - open data
  - git
references:
  - type: database
    title: "ระบบค้นหากฎหมาย (Law search system)"
    authors:
      - name: "Office of the Council of State (สำนักงานคณะกรรมการกฤษฎีกา)"
    url: "https://searchlaw.ocs.go.th"
